m That Summarizes and Evaluates Peer-Reviewed Scientific Articles#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[37,38],"#DietNerd: A Nutrition Question-Answering System That Summarizes and Evaluates Peer-Reviewed Scientific Articles#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[39,41],"#DietNerd: A Nutrition Question-Answering System That Summarizes and Evaluates Peer-Reviewed Scientific Articles#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[40,41],"#DietNerd: A Nutrition Question-Answering System That Summarizes and Evaluates Peer-Reviewed Scientific Articles#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[42,44],"#DietNerd: A Nutrition Question-Answering System That Summarizes and Evaluates Peer-Reviewed Scientific Articles#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[43,44],"#DietNerd: A Nutrition Question-Answering System That Summarizes and Evaluates Peer-Reviewed Scientific Articles#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[45,46]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/TYDCGI3H","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 17","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/QH74YM89?page=17&annotation=TYRYWNJT","line":34},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/QH74YM89?page=1&annotation=QESS4ZEX","line":37},{"title":"Sayfa 17","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/QH74YM89?page=17&annotation=MMGG9YAL","line":40},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/QH74YM89?page=1&annotation=KQTVP2VY","line":43},{"title":"Sayfa 17","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/QH74YM89?page=17&annotation=E8DJ2UNC","line":43}],"metadata":{"Title":"DietNerd: A Nutrition Question-Answering System That Summarizes and Evaluates Peer-Reviewed Scientific Articles","Authors":"Shela Wu, Zubair Yacub, Dennis Shasha","Year":2024,"DOI":"10.3390/app14199021","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"DIETNERD is a large language model-based system designed to enhance public health education in diet and nutrition. The system responds to user questions with concise, evidence-based summaries and assesses the quality and potential biases of cited research. This paper describes the system’s workflow, back-end implementation, and the prompts used. Accuracy and quality-ofresponse results are presented based on an automated comparison against systematic surveys and against the responses of similar state-of-the-art systems through human feedback from registered dietitians.","Findings":"accuracy. Compared to other state-of-the-art systems, DIETNERD is among the best based on expert (i.e., registered dietitian) reviews","Conclusions":"Thus, DIETNERD could be a tool to bridge the gap between complex scientific literature and public understanding.In this context, DIETNERD can play a role in augmenting existing healthcare resources.  By providing scientifically grounded, easily digestible information, our tool can answer fundamental questions during the waiting period between appointments. This is not to suggest that DIETNERD should replace professional consultation; rather, it serves as a complementary resource that can enhance the patient experience and preparedness.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"çok güzel, türkçesi veya işbirlikleri için iletişime geçebilirsin. literatür taramadı, sosyal medyada bilgi doğrulama vb..  dyt değerlendirmesi var ama karşılaştırma değil snırım. promptlar açık olark verilmemiş  doğrulama gerekiyorr"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"8n72g7","at":1774939741963},"key":"Augmented Dietitian/wuDietNerdNutritionQuestionAnswering2024b.md"},
